  "details": "It would be absolutely amazing if we could create objects that can grab and pose PhysBones. I would asuume it would be added as a new component in the SDK.\n\nI see this being used for weapons, toys, and other small tricks where it would be desirable to grab a PhysBone with a prop. It would also be very useful for avatars with multiple but controllable limbs, implementing biting PhysBones, or even DIY desktop posing of PhysBones powered by OSC.\n\nnakos",
